    "html": "\n        <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n          <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span>\n          <span class=\"time\">40 min</span>\n          <span class=\"chip accent\">HLD design</span>\n          <span class=\"chip kafka\">Kafka</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Amazon</span><span class=\"chip company\">Google</span><span class=\"chip company\">Microsoft</span><span class=\"chip company\">Flipkart</span>\n        </div>\n        <h1>Video Streaming (Netflix)</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Design a service where millions of people press Play at the same evening hour and the picture starts in about a second and never stutters. You will see why the video bytes almost never come from the \"cloud\" at all.</p>\n      "
